#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Replay and Slop: two benchmarks of AI models as engineers on OpenRamble.

DESIGN.md says what is measured and why. This file is the whole harness:

    bench replay check <task>          prove a task: red on the parent, green on the reference
    bench replay wrong <task>          grade a deliberately wrong change; it must not pass
    bench replay run <task> <model>    one model, one task, graded
    bench replay grade <run>           grade a saved change again
    bench slop run [model ...]         the writing jobs
    bench slop score                   count the words, and check the facts
    bench slop repeat <job> <n>        one job many times
    bench report                       results/REPORT.md and results/index.html
    bench pilot                        everything above for the pilot set
"""
